    dmo:diabetesTypeCode "type-1-diabetes" ;
    dmo:insulinRequired "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
    dmo:mondoCode "MONDO:0005147" ;
    dmo:name "Type 1 diabetes" ;
    dmo:prevalenceShare "0.1"^^xsd:decimal ;
    dmo:typicalOnset "Childhood" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "In Type 1 diabetes also check daily for ketones if CBG >12mmol/L." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "However, the vast majority of these individuals will have type 1 diabetes, but some may have type 2 diabetes." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Treatment of steroid induced hyperglycaemia in people who have type 1 or type 2 diabetes (8)" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "The following options are recommended in women on oral treatment and/or single or multiple daily insulin:  Variable rate intravenous insulin infusions (VRIII)  • VRIII - Urea and electrolytes (U&Es) should be checked prior to starting a VRIII and repeated daily to monitor fluid balance and electrolyte abnormalities" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_08_hyperglycaemia_and_steroid_therapy_january_2023> .

