    dmo:statement "If a subsequent capillary glucose is found to be greater than 12.0mmol/L, then increase the frequency of testing to four times daily (before meals and before bed)" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "If a subsequent capillary glucose is found to be greater than 12.0mmol/L, then increase the frequency of testing to four times daily (before meals and before bed)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_08_hyperglycaemia_and_steroid_therapy_january_2023> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/increased-glucose-testing-when-blood-glucose-exceeds-12-0mmol-l> a dmo:Recommendation ;
